sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Alice as Customer
  actor Bob
  Alice->>+Bob: Hello end %% is message text
  Bob-->>-Alice: Response
  Alice<<-->>Bob: Bidirectional
  Alice-xBob: Failure
  Alice--)Bob: Async
  activate Bob
  Note over Alice,Bob: Don't parse loop or %% here
  loop Retry while end is pending
    alt Successful request
      Bob->>Alice: A literal " in a message
      Alice-->>Bob: It stays on one line
    else Failure
      Bob-->>Alice: Retry
    end
  end
  deactivate Bob
  create participant Carol
  destroy Carol
  %% This is a comment
